🧶
"Pounce"/en"扑击"/zh-CN"撲擊"/zh-TW
=== start
¶Steer a cat with the arrow keys and pounce.

The cat meows every time it moves. The meow hangs on the first @Pose of its
moving animation: a @Pose can carry a @Music, which plays the moment that pose
is struck, and a move strikes its poses each time one begins. The sway is
written out rather than left as \Sequence.sway()\ because the ready-made
animations build their own poses, and a pose is where the sound has to go.¶

¶One short cry. Two moves close together share a meow rather than stacking two,
since the second arrives while the first sway is still swaying.¶
meow: 🎼(🎶([1] instrument: 🔈.🐱) volume: 45% name: 'meow')

•CatPosition(position•#m direction•#)

key: Key()
speed: 1m

kittyPlace: CatPosition(5m 1) … ∆ key …
    ((key = "ArrowLeft") & (kittyPlace.position > -10m)) ? CatPosition(kittyPlace.position - speed 1) 
    	((key = "ArrowRight") & (kittyPlace.position < 8m)) ? CatPosition(kittyPlace.position + speed -1) 
    		kittyPlace

kitty: Phrase(
    "🐈"
    face: "Noto Color Emoji"
    name: "kitty"
    size: 2m
    place: Place(kittyPlace.position 0m)
    resting: Pose(flipx: kittyPlace.direction < 0)
    moving: Sequence(
        {
            0%: Pose(rotation: -5° music: meow)
            50%: Pose(rotation: 5°)
            100%: Pose(rotation: -5°)
        }
        0.25s
        "zippy"
    )
    matter: Matter(1000kg roundedness: 0.5)
)

pounce: Collision('ball' 'kitty')

ballPlace: Motion(
    Place(0m 9m)
    nextvelocity:
        pounce•ø ? ø
            Velocity(
                ((pounce.direction.x ÷ -1m) × Random(15m/s 25m/s)) + Random(-3m/s 3m/s)
                Random(27m/s 30m/s)
                (pounce.direction.x ÷ -1m) × Random(0°/s 15°/s))
)

ball: Phrase("🧶" name: 'ball' place: ballPlace matter: Matter(1kg 0.5 0 1))

Stage(
    [
        Shape(Rectangle(-10m 0m 10m -3m))
        Shape(Rectangle(-10m -1m -9m 11m))
        Shape(Rectangle(10m -1m 9m 11m))
        Shape(Rectangle(-10m 10m 10m 11m))
        ball 
        kitty
        Phrase("press ← → to play!" place: Place(-4m -2m) color: Color.white)
    ] 
    place: Place(y: 5m z: -10m)
)